# Rust CLI is the indexed product; site/ is marketing + plugin surface.
# Keep GitHub language stats and search indexing on the Rust crate.
site/** linguist-vendored
extensions/** linguist-vendored
docs/assets/** linguist-vendored
docs/index.html linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored

# LF everywhere, no CRLF churn on Windows checkouts
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary